    },
    {
      "id": "search-needs-db3-v2",
      "disposition": "portable-after-db3-v2",
      "db3_operation_family": "candidate-search",
      "rationale": "The same shape as portable-search, refused by the wire rather than by the operation: DB3 v1 carries workspace, project and record_type and nothing else. These need an exact-label filter on search (four curator searches), a collection naming which vector column to rank against (claim, code_unit), negation (exclude_project), or set membership (kinds). A request built without the filter is well-formed, so every provider answers it happily and wrongly; the route must refuse to build one.",
      "symbols": [
        "pgvec_curator_claim_search",
        "pgvec_curator_code_unit_search",
        "pgvec_curator_entity_search",
